.TH ferry-identity-storage 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-identity\-storage \- Show or change where the key is kept: `file` (default) or `system` (Secret Service / KWallet / GNOME Keyring on Linux, Credential Manager on Windows)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry identity storage\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISTORAGE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show or change where the key is kept: `file` (default) or `system` (Secret Service / KWallet / GNOME Keyring on Linux, Credential Manager on Windows)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fISTORAGE\fR]
Where to move the key; without it the current place is shown
